### =====================================================
### ms-auth - Documentacion de endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8002
### =====================================================

@base = http://localhost:8002
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Salud del microservicio
GET {{base}}/

### Iniciar sesion (por usuario o por correo)
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "usuario": "admin",
    "contrasena": "admin123"
}

### Validar sesion (token en header Authorization)
GET {{base}}/validar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar sesion
POST {{base}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
